Subject: Admit original Domination gameplay options before captain selection
Upstream-base: f75ccf1ad20e5bd7585962990db08067c0ae498a
Classification: temporary explicit original-source diagnostic admission; depends on 0506.

The authored MainMenu-to-Grudge-Match transition pushes SCENE_GAMEPLAY_OPTIONS
(27) first; its Done handler commits the settings and pushes the Domination
captain page (2), whose Back pushes 27 again. Move only factory case 27
(SHGameplayOptions) under the existing Domination admission. Placement
allocation and the constructor stay literal; its cheat list (28) and every
other case keep their current guards.

SHGameplayOptions stores its option/cheat row numbers in pointer-button
contexts. Native builds transport those genuine numeric 0..n values at native
pointer width; each console statement is kept unchanged.

